{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Abmaj7]They begged him not to go up [Bb]there
But [Abmaj7]Paul stood [Bb]firm in the air
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Why are you weep[Bb]ing and [Cm7]breaking my heart
[Abmaj7]I [Bb]am ready to [Cm7]be bound apart
[Eb]Even [Bb]to die for [Cm7]the Lord Jesus name
In Je[Ab]rusalem [Bb]I do not [Eb]shame
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
The [Abmaj7]Lord’s will be [Bb]done we [Cm7]said
The [Ab]belt tied the [Bb]prophecy a[Eb]head
{end_of_verse}
